works. The full Greek text of the commentary is in &lt;i>Journal of Theological
Studies&lt;/i>, X (1909), 29-51. The reference appears in &lt;b>74&lt;/b>:20 of Origen’s
&lt;i>Commentary&lt;/i>. The text is as follows:  &lt;/span>&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>